{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cadens Caelo</strong> is a third-person, story-driven exploration RPG set across a mysterious chain of forgotten islands. You awaken without memories, surrounded by remnants of a world that once knew you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966850/extras/e8fbb97b52bbe97e539d540a6e735052.avif?t=1758542098\" alt=\"Logo\" width=1024 height=495 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a wandering soul cast from the skies, you must traverse these strange lands, collect fragments of your past, survive ancient threats, and slowly understand why you were brought back\u2026 and by whom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every island reveals part of the truth. Some will guide you. Others will try to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memory-Based Progression</strong> \u2013 Discover who you were through fragments and visions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Islands</strong> \u2013 Each location features unique biomes, secrets, and lore pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966850/extras/65803e737f4050839d9514ce752f3fc5.avif?t=1758542098\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Survival</strong> \u2013 Gather rare seeds, manage resources, and survive the unknown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Encounters</strong> \u2013 Face ancient guardians, shifting weather, and reactive wildlife.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-Locked Events</strong> \u2013 Certain discoveries only appear under specific world states.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Handholding</strong> \u2013 Explore freely, make choices, and uncover the truth at your own pace.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966850/extras/1cc89f467b8e9724e5f7e27a290c8b3c.avif?t=1758542098\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966850?t=1758542098","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966850/bce5e8fc724dec4bf427e15d5421503f77ef60cc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758542098","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966850/dfe93fbf4d5732c72cc4715b4a07731c3b5835e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758542098","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966850/dfe93fbf4d5732c72cc4715b4a07731c3b5835e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758542098","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cadens Caelo</strong> is a third-person, story-driven exploration RPG set across a mysterious chain of forgotten islands. You awaken without memories, surrounded by remnants of a world that once knew you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966850/extras/e8fbb97b52bbe97e539d540a6e735052.avif?t=1758542098\" alt=\"Logo\" width=1024 height=495 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a wandering soul cast from the skies, you must traverse these strange lands, collect fragments of your past, survive ancient threats, and slowly understand why you were brought back\u2026 and by whom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every island reveals part of the truth. Some will guide you. Others will try to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memory-Based Progression</strong> \u2013 Discover who you were through fragments and visions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Islands</strong> \u2013 Each location features unique biomes, secrets, and lore pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966850/extras/65803e737f4050839d9514ce752f3fc5.avif?t=1758542098\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Survival</strong> \u2013 Gather rare seeds, manage resources, and survive the unknown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Encounters</strong> \u2013 Face ancient guardians, shifting weather, and reactive wildlife.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-Locked Events</strong> \u2013 Certain discoveries only appear under specific world states.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Handholding</strong> \u2013 Explore freely, make choices, and uncover the truth at your own pace.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966850/extras/1cc89f467b8e9724e5f7e27a290c8b3c.avif?t=1758542098\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Pixeliu Seklos"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store